tools.description:
Manage external references of the active drawing (names from list_xrefs, '*' for all top-level):
- reload: load again from the file (after it changed or was unloaded);
- unload: hide without removing (keeps the reference, frees memory);
- detach: remove the reference and all its insertions;
- bind: make it part of this drawing as a block, layers renamed XREF$0$LAYER (like BIND);
- insert: same, but layers and styles merge with this drawing's names (like BIND Insert);
- repath: point one reference to another file (path), then reload it.
Only loaded references can be bound. Returns the xref list afterwards. One undo step.
